    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d459">

                <pb facs="0632" n="536" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg536"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856d.6363/74: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-04-22T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 22,
                                1921—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>25. Your telegram 45 of April 18, 6 p.m. See note under date of November 2,
                        1920,<anchor n="14" xml:id="d459-f1"/> especially paragraph number eight,
                    enclosed with instruction 97, November 11, 1920.<anchor n="15" xml:id="d459-f2"
                    /> Much publicity is being given to the subject of the Djambi oil concession. If
                    the Senate publishes report<anchor n="16" xml:id="d459-f3"/> referred to in
                    Department’s telegram 2, January 18, 6 p.m.,<anchor n="17" xml:id="d459-f4"/>
                    further public notice will be drawn to this concession. With this publicity, if
                    American interests are practically completely excluded from the Dutch oil
                    business, an unfavorable impression would be created and the situation would be
                    discouraging to Americans considering participation in other lines of Dutch
                    industry.</p>
                <p>With respect to its future attitude regarding American investments in the
                    Netherland East Indies, the Department does not desire to commit itself to the
                    extent suggested in your telegram under reference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
